id: pm-2ga1g7
title: "GH-1109: tracker-context seeding writes an empty settings history document"
description: "Track the reported linked-test tracker sandbox regression where seeding settings.json appends a _workspace settings:write history entry whose replayed document is empty, causing nested validate --check-history-drift --strict-exit to fail."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: history-integrity,linked-tests,regression,tracker-context
created_at: "2026-08-24T22:37:40.571Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-25T07:06:29.714Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-25T07:06:03.153Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-25T07:06:03.153Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: The tracker sandbox writes byte-equivalent final settings content to settings.json and the authoritative workspace history event; Nested validate --check-history-drift --strict-exit passes for non-trivial tracker-mode settings; Schema mode remains isolated and behavior-compatible; Repeated seeding is deterministic and does not duplicate or reorder history unexpectedly; A negative control with an empty replay document fails the exact strict history gate
parent: pm-doxj
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
repro_steps: "Create a fresh tracker with non-trivial settings, add a linked test running pm validate --check-history-drift --strict-exit with pm_context_mode=tracker, then run the linked test and observe _workspace settings.json drift."
resolution: "When source settings exist without workspace history, linked-test seeding now replaces the initializer snapshot with an audited creation event over the exact source settings bytes; existing source history, including genuine drift, remains unchanged."
expected_result: Tracker-context linked tests validate an exact source tracker without inventing workspace-state drift.
actual_result: "Legacy trackers without _workspace history inherited the sandbox initializer history, so nested strict validation compared source settings against an unrelated initialized snapshot."
affected_version: 2026.8.23
component: linked-test tracker context
regression: true
customer_impact: Projects cannot combine pm test tracker context with the recommended strict history-drift governance gate without false failures.
